{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ever wondered what it'd be like if money grew on trees?\u00a0\ud83d\udcb8\ud83c\udf33<br><strong>An incremental-minimalist clicker farming game about growing your own farm full of money trees!</strong>  <br><strong>Click. Water. Grow. Harvest. Explore. Upgrade. Profit.</strong><br><strong>Online co-op supported!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794300/extras/ff1cbe56a715c4ed2cd77c9489732728.poster.avif?t=1755783273\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794300/extras/ff1cbe56a715c4ed2cd77c9489732728.webm?t=1755783273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794300/extras/ff1cbe56a715c4ed2cd77c9489732728.mp4?t=1755783273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40+ trees to grow, start small and expand to a sprawling money tree farm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click to harvest money from trees (because everybody knows that money does indeed grow on trees)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your garden by building new crop plots and trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore to find chests and gold bars to unlock new and bigger trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water your crops for faster growth or wait for time to grow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tools and equipment to farm and explore even faster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build greenhouses and watering systems to speed up growth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tree rarities: Common, Uncommon, Rare, Legendary, Mythical, Divine, Unbelievable</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3794300?t=1755783273","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794300/6741809ae2cdfa15098492b1d8451b07feafa6d4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755783273","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794300/7cb612486f7c8596c7e8b78d80c0cbe83aed3ba6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755783273","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794300/7cb612486f7c8596c7e8b78d80c0cbe83aed3ba6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755783273","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ever wondered what it'd be like if money grew on trees?\u00a0\ud83d\udcb8\ud83c\udf33<br><strong>An incremental-minimalist clicker farming game about growing your own farm full of money trees!</strong>  <br><strong>Click. Water. Grow. Harvest. Explore. Upgrade. Profit.</strong><br><strong>Online co-op supported!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794300/extras/ff1cbe56a715c4ed2cd77c9489732728.poster.avif?t=1755783273\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794300/extras/ff1cbe56a715c4ed2cd77c9489732728.webm?t=1755783273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794300/extras/ff1cbe56a715c4ed2cd77c9489732728.mp4?t=1755783273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40+ trees to grow, start small and expand to a sprawling money tree farm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click to harvest money from trees (because everybody knows that money does indeed grow on trees)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your garden by building new crop plots and trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore to find chests and gold bars to unlock new and bigger trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water your crops for faster growth or wait for time to grow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tools and equipment to farm and explore even faster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build greenhouses and watering systems to speed up growth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tree rarities: Common, Uncommon, Rare, Legendary, Mythical, Divine, Unbelievable</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["Tbjbu2"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794300/34975b796f6ca805864e0bbd141917db1d2ee5c8/header.jpg?t=1755783273","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3794300/1695771528/4ebc2214a44db3d1ef6735d8895073143fe59b8d/1755778876/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755783269","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3794300/1695771528/4ebc2214a44db3d1ef6735d8895073143fe59b8d/1755778876/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755783269","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3794300/1695771528